# ⚡ EV Range & Route Intelligence System

An enterprise-grade, multi-page Streamlit application that predicts real-time Electric Vehicle (EV) battery consumption, range viability, and route energy drain using Machine Learning combined with live public GIS, traffic, weather, and charging infrastructure telemetry.

---

## 📌 Features & Highlights

* **🧠 Machine Learning Core**: Random Forest Regressor (`models/ev_rf_model.pkl`) trained on trip distance, ambient temperature, estimated vehicle speed, and dynamic payload.
* **🚗 Dynamic Vehicle Selector**: Pre-configured profiles for multiple popular EV models with custom battery capacities (kWh) and base efficiency ratings (Wh/km).
* **⚖️ Smart Payload Estimator**:
  * Passenger weight slider (kg) for rapid adjustment.
  * User-friendly luggage selection dropdown (Backpack, Standard Suitcase, Family Trip, Heavy Cargo) mapped automatically to exact numerical kilograms.
* **🏎️ Driver Behavior & Terrain Physics**:
  * **Driving Mode Selector**: *Eco-Cruising*, *Normal*, and *Sport/Aggressive* modes dynamically scale speed inputs.
  * **Terrain Profile Selector**: *Flat Highway (1.0x)*, *Rolling Hills (1.12x)*, and *Steep Mountain Pass (1.28x)* physics multipliers.
* **🌱 Green Tech Sustainability Metrics**: Calculates real-time **CO₂ emissions saved (kg)** compared to petrol vehicles and **estimated fuel cost savings**.
* **🌐 Live Telemetry Integration (Simulated Connectivity)**:
  * **OpenStreetMap Nominatim API**: Geocoding origin and destination locations.
  * **OSRM (Open Source Routing Machine) API**: Dynamic road distance calculation and polyline geometry generation.
  * **Open-Meteo API**: Live ambient temperature and wind speed telemetry.
  * **Overpass API**: Live query and map overlay of real-world EV charging infrastructure along the route corridor.
* **🎨 Dark-Tech Professional Interface**: Native `.streamlit/config.toml` styling with custom Folium interactive mapping and session-state persistence across pages.

---

## 📁 Project Directory Structure

```text
your-project-folder/
│
├── .streamlit/
│   └── config.toml                  # Dark theme styling configuration
│
├── dataset/
│   └── EV_Range_Prediction_Dataset_2000.csv  # Model training dataset
│
├── models/
│   └── ev_rf_model.pkl              # Trained Random Forest ML model
│
├── modules/
│   ├── auth.py                      # Authentication / Login logic
│   ├── clean_data.py                 # Data cleaning utilities
│   └── vehicle_dict.py              # EV vehicle specifications dictionary
│
├── pages/
│   ├── 1_Live_Prediction.py         # Journey inputs, API queries & ML prediction
│   └── 2_Route_map.py               # Folium interactive route map & charging stations
│
├── static/
│   └── logo.png                     # Sidebar branding logo
│
├── Templates/
│   └── .gitkeep                     # Template placeholder
│
├── app.py                           # Application entry point / Landing page
├── Readme.md                        # Documentation
└── train.py                         # Model training script